OL,3,ARussell Brand says allegations had
OL,4,Adevastating impact on him
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand has said a documentary
OL,7,Fthat made allegations about his
OL,8,Fbehaviour had a "devastating" effect on
OL,9,Fhim, and made friends and colleagues
OL,10,Fturn against him.
OL,12,FThe entertainer has begun giving
OL,13,Fevidence as his defence case gets under
OL,14,Fway at his trial at Southwark Crown
OL,15,FCourt.
OL,17,FBrand, 51, is accused of three counts
OL,18,Fof rape, three counts of sexual
OL,19,Fassault, and one charge of attempted
OL,20,Findecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
