OL,3,ARussell Brand says allegations had
OL,4,Adevastating impact on him
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe allegations, made by six female
OL,7,Fcomplainants, span a 10-year period
OL,8,Fbetween 1999 and 2009. He denies all
OL,9,Fthe charges.
